{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>And their encampments.</b> Palaces, like \"silver palace\" (Song of Songs 8:9)." "<b>To their nations.</b> In the Bible we find אמות, אומים (nations), and the lamed of לאמותם is added like the lamed of לגוייהם. It is not like the lamed of בלאמים (Psalms 149:7), for that is a root, like \"and the one nation shall be stronger than the other nation\" (Genesis 25:23). And the reason that it appears both with and without the lamed is identical, and they are two roots."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:45:45.365151261Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}